<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">EFZ - Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">Efz</para>
  <para style="toc2">Befezi</para>
  <para style="toc1">AMARUBA EMWA ABEFEZI</para>
  <para style="h">Emwa Abefezi</para>
  <para style="mt1">AMARUBA EMWA ABEFEZI<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abanya-Efezi; Bantu b'Efezi, Abahubukaga e Efezi</char></note></para>
  <para style="imt1">Enshokolezi oku maruba emwa Abefezi</para>
  <para style="ip">Nnâmahanga warheganyagya ebinja rhulimwo buno. Kurhenga mîra erhi ajira omuhigo gw’okuciza abantu n’okuhà ebintu byoshi mwâmi muguma, ye Kristu. Muli ye, Abayahudi n’abarhali Buyahudi bakola baguma: <char style="vp">2,13</char> <char style="iqt">« Lêro buno, muli Kristu, mwe mwâli kuli mîra, omukò gwa Kristu gwammushegezize hôfi.</char> <char style="vp">14</char> <char style="iqt">Nêci ye buholo bwîrhu, ye wajiraga ago mashanja gombi okubà liguma, ashâba ecisîka c’obushombanyi cakâg’ibaberûla;</char> <char style="vp">15</char> <char style="iqt">omu mubiri gwâge arhenza irhegeko haguma n’ebirhegesirwemwo n’ebigabi byâlyo, mpu lyo abo babiri abahindula muntu muguma muhyâhya muli ye, na ntyo alêrhe omurhûla;</char> <char style="vp">16</char> <char style="iqt">na bombi abajire mubiri muguma, anabagalule omu bwîra bwa Nnâmahanga omu kuyîrha obushombanyi bwâbo muli ye oku musalaba.</char> <char style="vp">17</char> <char style="iqt">Anaciyish’ihubuliza omurhûla kuli mwe, mwe mwâli kulî, n’obuholo kuli balya bâli hôfi.</char> <char style="vp">18</char> <char style="iqt">Nêci, oku rhulibabiri ye rhuhisa hali Îshe muli Mûka muguma yêne»</char>.</para>
  <para style="ip">Eco cinyabuguma cihyâhya c’abemêzi yo Ekleziya. Kristu ye Irhwe yêne wakerekaga emikolo y’oburhumisi (cig. 4) abarhumisi bagwâsirwe ngasi muguma alonze obunguke bwa boshi. Kristu yêne arhuhîre olwiganyo ly’obuzigire burhashuba nyuma. Acîshwêkire oku Ekleziya anayicêsa. Mpu obuhya bw’abakristu burhôlere olwiganyo aho, bunabè cimanyîso cihamîriza oburhahemuka bwa Kristu (cig. 5). Okubêra kwinjà kuli Kristu eri ntambala rhwalwa, ci rhurhalwisagya abirhu ci galya mahashe mabî shetani akolêsa mpu arhuyêgûle kuli Kristu (cig. 6).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>Paolo, Ntumwa ya Yezu Kristu oku bulonza bwa Nyamuzinda, oku batagatîfu n’abemêzi muli Kristu Yezu bali e Efezi. <verse eid="EPH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Kuli mwe engalo n’omurhûla gwa Larha Nnâmahanga na Nyakasane Yezu Kristu.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">I. Ihwe ly’obucunguzi n’ery'Ekleziya</para>
  <para style="s1">Kurhenga amango goshi erhi Nyamuzinda alonza okurhujira bâna bâge</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Ayâgirwe Nyamuzinda n’Îshe wa Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu, owarhugishaga, arhuhà obwangà bw’obunya-mûka bwa ngasi lubero, bwangà buhubu­ka omu mpingu muli Kristu!<verse eid="EPH 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Ntyo kwo acîrhwishozire muli ye embere igulu liremwe mpu rhubè batagatîfu na bêru-kwêru embere zâge omu buzigire,<verse eid="EPH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>oku bulonza gwâge yêne arhulondôla mpu rhuyish’ibà bâna bâge balere erhi Yezu Kristu orhuma,<verse eid="EPH 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>oku bukuze bw’irenge ly’engalo yâge arhushobôzagya muli Omugala Muzigirwa.<verse eid="EPH 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Muli ye rhubona obuyôkoke, mukò gwâge gurhumire, obwonjo oku byâha, nk’oku obuhirhi bw’engalo yâge bunali,<verse eid="EPH 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>eyo ngalo Nnâmahanga arhushobôzagya omu bushinganyanya n’omu bumanye.<verse eid="EPH 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Arhumanyîsa ihwe ly’obulonza gwâge, gulya muhigo gwâge gw’olukogo ali erhi ahizire muli Kristu,<verse eid="EPH 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>mpu lyo, hano amango gayunjula, aguyukiriza: okushubûliza ebintu byoshi muli Mwâmi muguma, yerigi Kristu, ebiri emalunga n’en’igulu.<verse eid="EPH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Muli ye kandi rhwacishozirwe mpu rhubè mîmo, rhwagoshôlwa kurhenga mîra oku bulonza bw’Olya ojira byoshi nk’oku alonzize yêne,<verse eid="EPH 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>mpu lyo rhwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rhwe: Bo Buyahudi abo; bakristu b’oku bûko, b’oku ishanja ly’Abayahudi.</char></note> rhwàli erhi rhulangâlira Kristu kurhenga mîra, rhubà bukuze bw’irenge lyâge.<verse eid="EPH 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Ninyu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ninyu: kwo kuderha abapagani abo; bakristu b’omu mashanja, bûko burhali bwa Buyahudi.</char></note> kwo na kwo, erhi muyûs’iyumva oluderho lw’okuli, yo Myanzi y’Akalembe k’obuyôkoke bwinyu, n’erhi mubà mwamâyêmêra, muli ye mwahirwakwo ecimanyîso ca Mûka Mutatagatîfu mwalaganyibagwa.<verse eid="EPH 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Oyo Mûka Mutatagatîfu co cikinja c’akashambala kîrhu, ye narheganya obucunguzi bw’olubaga Nyamuzinda acizagya, mpu lubè bukuze bw’irenge lyâge.<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristu ye Mwâmi mukulu w’ebintu byoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Co cirhumire, nâni erhi nyumva obuyêmêre bwinyu muli Nyakasane Yezu n’obuzigire bwinyu oku batagatîfu boshi, <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>ntacihusa okuvuga omunkwa mwe murhumire nka nammukengêra omu nsengero zâni, <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>nti Nyamuzinda wa Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu, Îshe w’irenge, ammuhè omurhima gw’obushinganyanya anammufulûlire amahwe gâge, lyo mumumanya bwinjà. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>Mâshi a­mmumolekere amasù g’omurhima, mubone bulangâlire buci mwahamagalîrwe na buhirhi buci bw’irenge akashambala kâge kammubîkîre omu karhî k’abatagatîfu, <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>mubone na bukulu buci burhajira Lugero obuhashe bwâge bwarhuhîre, rhwe bemêzi. Obwo buhashe bw’emisî yâge <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>abuyêrekîne muli Kristu erhi amufûla omu bafù anamubwârhaza ebwa kulyo kwâge omu mpingu, <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>enyanya bwenêne kulusha ngasi Bwâmi, ngasi Burhegesi, ngasi Buhashe na ngasi Burhwâli, na kulusha ngasi izîno liderhwa, arhali hano igulu hône, ci n’omu igulu lyâyisha. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/><char style="qt">Byoshi abihizire aha magulu gâge, amujira kasongêro k’ebintu byoshi, amujira irhwe ly’Ekleziya</char>, <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/><char style="qt">gwo mubiri gwâge, lyo n’ishwinjiro ly’olya oyunjuzize byoshi byoshi muli ngasi kantu</char>.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Kristu arhucungula buzira makwânane gîrhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Ninyu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ninyu: mwe bakristu mwarhenganga omu mûko garhali ga Buyahudi, mpu bo bapagani.</char></note> mwe mwâli mufîre n’obubî n’ebyâha binyu <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>mwalimwo mîra erhi mukashimba obugende bw’eri igulu n’okukashimba omuluzi w’obwâmi bw’omu cirêre, ye muzimu ntalikirira entumva… <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Câbà mushâna nîrhu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nîrhu: rhwe bakristu barhengaga omu mûko g’Abayahudi, mpu bakâg’ilinda Masiya kurhenga mîra</char></note> rhweshi rhwàli ba Lugero luguma nabo mîra omu kushimba amîru gîrhu mabî, omu kukolera iralà ly’omubiri n’enyifinjo mbî, n’oku bwôrhere bwîrhu rhwàli bâna ba bukunizi ak’abandi.<verse eid="EPH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Ci Nyamuzinda ntahwa-lukogo, obuzigire bwâge bunji arhuzigiremwo burhumire, <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>n’obwo rhwàli mifîriri erhi byâha bîrhu birhuma, arhufûla haguma na Kristu, -enali nshôkano yâge yammucizagya-; <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>arhufûla haguma naye, anarhubwârhaza omu mpingu muli Kristu Yezu, <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>mpu ayêrekane omu myâka yayisha obuhirhi burhajira Lugero bw’engalo yâge n’o­bwinjà bwâge kuli rhwe muli Kristu Yezu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Bulya, nêci, nshôkano yâge, kuhirakwo obuyêmêre, yammucizagya. Obwo bucire, arhali omu misî yinyu burhenga, ci eri ngalo ya Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>Arhali omu bijiro burhenga, mpu lyo halek’ibà owacîkuza. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Bulya rhuli mulimo gwâge, rhwalemirwe muli Kristu Yezu mpu rhujire ebijiro binjà Nyamuzinda arhurheganyizagya okukola.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abayahudi n’abarhali Bayahudi omu cinyabuguma ca Kristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Kengêri amango ga mîra, mwe bapagani, -mwâli bo omu mubiri gwinyu, mwa mwakâg’iderhwa bantakembûlwa na balya bacîderha bakembûle, erhi banali bo omu mubiri gwâbo gwakembûlagwa n’abantu-; <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>kengêri oku ago mango murhagwêrhe Kristu, mwâli bakagwa omu ishanja ly’Israheli, ntà cigabi mwagwêrhe omu ndagâno Nnâmahanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abapagani bagwêrhe bazimu banji, ci barhayishigi Nyamuzinda w’okuli.</char></note> alagânaga, mwâli mbula-bulangâlire na mbula-Nyamuzinda en’igulu. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Lêro buno, muli Kristu, mwe mwâli kulî mîra, omukò gwa Kristu gwammushegezize hôfi.<verse eid="EPH 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Nêci ye buholo bwîrhu, ye wajiraga ago mashanja gombi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ago mashanja gombi: Abayahudi n’abapagani.</char></note> okubà liguma, ashâba ecisîka c’obushombanyi cakâg’ibaberûla; <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>omu mubiri gwâge arhenza irhegeko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Irhegeko lya Mûsa lyàli cisîka ekarhî k’Abayahudi n’abandi bantu.</char></note> haguma n’ebirhegesirwemwo n’ebigabi byâlyo, mpu lyo abo babiri abahindula muntu muguma muhyâhya muli ye, na ntyo alêrhe omurhûla; <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>na bombi abajire mubiri muguma, anabagalule omu bwîra bwa Nnâmahanga omu kuyîrha obushombanyi bwâbo muli ye oku musalaba. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Anaciyish’ihubuliza omurhûla kuli mwe, mwe mwâli kulî, n’obuholo kuli balya bâli hôfi. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Nêci, oku rhuli babiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oku rhuli babiri: Abayahudi n’abapagani.</char></note> ye rhuhisa hali Îshe muli Mûka muguma yêne.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Na ntyo murhaciri b’embuga nîsi erhi bigolo, ci mukola ba mulala muguma n’abatagatîfu na bâna b’omu nyumpa ya Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Entumwa n’abalêbi co ciriba muyûbakîrwekwo, na Kristu Yezu Yenênè ye ibuye-kaboko ka nyumpa. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Muli ye mwo ngasi bûbake busîmbana bunashunjûka, bubè ka-Nyamuzinda katagatîfu muli Nyakasane. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Muli ye ninyu mwajîre omu bûbake mpu muhinduke ka-Nyamuzinda muli Mûka Mutagatîfu.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Paolo mujà-bugo w’ihwe lya Kristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Co irhumire, nie ono Paolo, ndi mushwêke wa Kristu Yezu mwe bapagani murhumire. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Bulya nkabaga mwayumvîrhe kurhi Nyamuzinda anshobôzagya enshôkano yâge mpu mmuhise kuli yo, <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>n’oku anfulûliraga ery’ihwe, nk’okûla mmuyandikîre omu nderho nsungunu. <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>Omu kusoma ebi mmuyandikîre ninyu mwêne mwaciyumviza obumanye njira bw’ihwe lya Kristu. <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Ery’ihwe lirhàli lisag’ibwîrwa abantu ba mîra nk’oku likola limanyirwe n’entumwa zâge ntagatîfu n’abalêbi muli Mûka Mutagatîfu: <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Abapagani bakola bayêmêrîrwe okuyish’ihâbwa kashambala kaguma, bakola babà birumbu bya mubiri muguma, banakola bashangira eciragâne muli Kristu Yezu erhi Myanzi y’Akalembe erhuma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ababatizibwe boshi, bakabà bapagani erhi Buyahudi, bali bâna ba Nnâmahanga.</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Nahindusire mujà-bugo w’eyo Myanzi y’Akalembe erhi nshôkano y’engalo Nyamuzinda anshobôzagya erhuma, ayêrekana obuhashe bw’okuboko kwâge. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Nie munyi omu bakristu boshi, nie nashobwîre enshôkano y’okumanyîsa abapagani obuhirhi bwa Kristu burhajira Lugero <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>n’okuyêreka abantu boshi lirya ihwe lyàli lifulike kurhenga emyâka n’emyâka muli Nyamuzinda, Mulemi w’ebintu byoshi. <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>Obwo bushinganyanya bwa Nyamuzinda burhajira oku bwankagerwa, ciru n’Amâmi n’Amahashe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amâmi n’Amahashe g’omu mpingu, bo bamalahika.</char></note> g’omu mpingu, erhi gabona Ekleziya lyo gabumanyire. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Ntyo kwo Nnâmahanga àli alâlîre kurhenga emyâka n’emyâka okuyish’ijira muli Nnawîrhu Kristu Yezu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Ye rhuhà, akabà rhuyêmîre, oburhwâli bw’okuyegera Nyamuzinda buzira bwôba. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Ntyo mmuhûnyire nti murharhemukaga erhi malibuko gâni garhuma, bulya lyo irenge linyu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gwa Paolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Co cirhumire nfukama embere za Nyamuzinda Îshe, <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>y’Îshe wa ngasi mubusi oli empingu n’igulu, <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>nti ahume omu buhirhi bw’irenge lyâge, a­mmukomeze n’obuzibu bwa Mûka Mutagatîfu, ly’omuntu muhyâhya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oyo muntu muhyâhya, bwo buzîne Mûka Mutatagatîfu arhuhà omu bubatizo.</char></note> ommulimwo ayûshûka, <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>lyo na Kristu abêra omu mirhima yinyu erhi buyêmêre bwinyu burhuma. Mumere emizî omu buzigire, munasêre omu buzigire, <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>lyo muhash’iyumva, mwe n’abemêzi boshi, obugali n’obulî, oburherema n’obwandagala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okwo kwoshi kuli kuderha oku ihwe lya Nnâmahanga lirhajira Lugero.</char></note>, <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>munamanye obuzigire bwa Kristu, ciru bukabà bulushire ngasi bukengêre, na ntyo muyunjule obuhirhi bwa Nnâmahanga bwoshi. <verse eid="EPH 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Kuli Oyo ogwêrhe obuhashe bw’okurhujirira ngasi kantu rhwankashenga erhi kugerêre­za, ciru analushîse, Oyo obushashe bwâge bukola omu mirhima yîrhu, <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>kuli Ye irenge omu Ekleziya na muli Kristu Yezu, kuhika amango goshi n’emyâka n’emyâka! Amen!<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="ms1">II. Amahano g’okushwinja</para>
  <para style="s1">Okuyumvanya n’okubêra omu cinyabuguma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Mmuhûnyire, nie mushwêke muli Nyakasane, nti olugendo lwinyu lulingânane n’obwôrhere mwahamagirwemwo. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>Mubè bîrhôhye na batûdu, munalemberane; muyumvanye omu buzigire, <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>munacîsêze okulanga obuguma bwa Mûka Mutagatîfu omu murhûla gw’ecinyabuguma. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Omubiri guli muguma na Mûka Mutatagatîfu ali muguma; n’obulangâlire mwahamagirwemwo na­bwo buli buguma. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Nyakasane ali muguma Yêne, n’obuyêmêre buli buguma, n’obubatizo buli buguma. <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>Nyamuzinda ali muguma, y’Îshe w’abantu boshi, ye kulîre boshi, akola muli boshi, anabà muli boshi. <verse eid="EPH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Ci kwônene ngasi muguma muli rhwe ahâbirwe eyâge ngalo nk’oku anatwîragwa n’enshôkano ya Kristu. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Kwo Amandiko gadesire, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4, 8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Lul 68, 18</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Arheremîre emalunga, ahêka abà­bôhe, agabira abantu enshôkano</char>. <verse eid="EPH 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/><char style="qt">«Arheremîre», kwo kuderha kurhi? Ka kurhali kuderha oku ali arhanzir’iyandagalira omu kuzimu?</char> <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/><char style="qt">Oyo wayandagalaga, ye wanarheremaga, arhaluka amalunga goshi, mpu abè ishwinjiro ly’ebintu byoshi</char>. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Kandi ye washobôzagya: baguma okubà ntumwa, abandi okubà balêbi erhi bajà-bugo b’Emyanzi y’Akalembe, n’abandi okubà balungere erhi bayigîriza, <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>akeresa ntyo abemêzi omu mukolo gw’oburhumisi, mpu lyo ayûbaka omubiri gwa Kristu, <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>kuhika rhweshi haguma rhuhike omu cinyabuguma c’obuyêmêre n’ec’okumanya Mugala wa Nnâmahanga, rhulinde rhubà muntu mwimâna, rhuhike oku Lugero lukwânîne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekleziya lyo ishwinjiro ly’omubiri gwa Kristu, na ngasi babatizibwe byo birumbu by’o­gwo mubiri. Ngasi muguma muli rhwe kukwânîne acîsêze okubà mwimâna, okubà Mutagatîfu, lyo Ekleziya ehika oku Lugero lukwânîne ishwinjiro ly’omubiri gwa Kristu.</char></note> ishwinjiro ly’omubiri gwa Kristu. <verse eid="EPH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Ntyo lêro rhurhaciyôrhe nka bâna ba birhabà bayêhûlwa eyi n’eyi na ngasi mpûsi y’enyigîrizo zarhenga omu bunywesi bw’abantu n’omu bulyâlya bwâbo bw’okurhebana. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Ci omu kujira eby’okuli omu buzigire, rhwayûshûka omu ngasi njira, rhuyegere irhwe, ye Kristu. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>Ye hà omubiri gwoshi okusimbana n’okusêra haguma oku burhabâle bw’enungo zoshi zigulisa n’omukolo gwa ngasi cirumbu; na ntyo kwo kushunjûka n’okucîyûbaka gwône omu buzigire.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuzîne buhyâhya muli Kristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Lêro mâshi, mmubwîzire nnammugashire muli Nyakasane, nti murhacikâg’iyôrha nka bapagani bakashimba enkengêro zâbo za busha. <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>Obukengêre bwâbo buyunjwîre mwizimya, n’obuhwinja bw’omurhima gwâbo guhûsire bwarhumîre barhabona obuzîne bwa Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Bàcibêrire bacikala-nshonyi, bashimba engeso mbî y’okuhusha, bagwîra okukâjira eby’enshonyi bya ngasi lubero. <verse eid="EPH 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Ci mwêhe arhali ntyo kwo mwayigîrizibwe Kristu, <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>akabà mwamuyumvîrhe n’akabà mwayigîrizibwe muli ye nka kulyâla binali muli Yezu.<verse eid="EPH 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>Mwayigîrizibwe oku murhegesirwe okuleka obwôrhere bwinyu burhanzi n’okuhogola omuntu wa mîra<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omuntu wa mîra y’olya wali omu bujà bw’ebyâha, n’omuhyâhya y’olya waburhagwa omu mîshi g’obubatizo.</char></note>, olya ojà wabola omu kushimba enyifinjo mbî, <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>lyo muhinduka bahyâhya omu murhima n’omu nkengêro zinyu, <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>munacîhundikire omuntu muhyâhya, olya Nyamuzinda alemaga oku nshusho yâge omu bushinganyanya n’omu butagatîfu bw’okunali. <verse eid="EPH 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Lêro ntà kucikaz’inywerha, ci ngasi muguma akabwîra abâbo eby’okuli, bulya rhweshi rhubà ngasi muguma birumbu by’abâbo. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Mukunire, ci murhajiraga câha: izûba lirhazikaga n’obukunizi bucimmugwêrhe<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4, 26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:5">Lul 4, 5</ref>.</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Mumanye mwankahà hishetani engwârhiro. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Ngasi wali cishambo agokôle; akole n’amaboko gâge erhikwo nk’oku bishingânîne, ciru ahash’irhabâla ab’obuligo. <verse eid="EPH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Ntà luderho lubî lurhengage omu kanwa kinyu; mukaderha ebiwa binjà byône, birya byankabà lwingayo lwinjà oku bandi amango gakwânîne, n’okulêrhera ababiyumva akamalo. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Mumanye murhajiraga Mûka Mutatagatîfu gwa Nyamuzinda burhè<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngasi câha cijira Mûka Mutagatîfu burhè, bwenêne ebyâha bisherêza ecinyabuguma c’Ekleziya.</char></note>, ye wammuhiragakwo ecimanyîso c’olusiku lw’obucunguzi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">olusiku ly’obucunguzi: Aha kuyûrha kw’igulu lyo rhwacunguka lwoshi, olusiku rhwarhengamwo olu lubanda lw’emirenge.</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Omujina, ennongwè, obukunizi, akadali, ebijâci, ebyôla byoshi birhenge ekarhî kinyu, haguma na ngasi coshi ciderhwa cibî. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Muciyêrekane binjà erhikwo na ba lukogo baguma oku bandi, omu kubabalirana mwêne na nnene nka kulya Nnâmahanga ammubabaliraga muli Kristu.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Nêci, mucîsêze okushusha Nnâmahanga nka bâna bâge bazigirwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>Mukâyôrha muzigirîne nka kulya Kristu ammuzigiraga, acîhâna yêne erhi rhwe rhurhuma mpu abè ntûlo na nterekêro y’okusîmîsa Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="EPH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Obugonyi bôhe na ngasi bindi by’enshonyi n’amagene g’eby’en’igulu, ciru amazîno gâbyo garhakag’iderhwa ekarhî kinyu: ntyo kwo kushingânîne abatagatîfu. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Ntà kuganîra eby’enshonyi, nîsi erhi okuderha ebirhagwêrhi nda na mugongo, erhi okushesa abandi n’ebinwa bibî: ebyôla byoshi birhakwânîni; mukaz’ivuga Nnâmahanga omunkwa erhikwo. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Mumanye kwinjà oku ntà mugonyi, ntà mûmaguza, na ntâye ohubira eby’en’igulu, -kwo kuli kufukamîra ebiremwa-, ntâye muli abo boshi wanalabarhe omu Bwâmi bwa Kristu na Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="EPH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Harhajiraga owammurheba n’ebinwa by’obunywesi: ebyo byo bihamagala obukunizi bwa Nyamuzinda oku bamugomera. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Mumanyage mwankashangîra obubî bwâbo.<verse eid="EPH 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Mîra mwâli omu mwizimya, buno lêro mukò­la muli bulangashane muli Nyakasane; muyôrhe nka bâna ba bumoleke. <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>Na ngasi hiri hinjà, ngasi hishingânîne, na ngasi hiri hy’okuli, yo mburho y’obulangashane. <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Mulongereze ebisimîsize Nyakasane; <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>munamanye mwankashangîra emikolo y’omwizimya erhajira kamalo, ci muyêrekane obubî bwâyo erhi­kwo. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Bulya ebi abo bantu bajira bufundafunda, ziri nshonyi okubiderha. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Ci ebiyêrekanwa byoshi kubonekana bibonekana n’obwâlagale; na ngasi coshi cibonekana n’obwâlagale bubà bumoleke. <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>Co cirhuma baderha, mpu: «Tulûka, weri îrò, zûka omu bafù, Kristu âkumolekera». <verse eid="EPH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Ntyo mumanye bwinjà olugendo lwinyu; murhahimbaga nka bingolongolo, ci mubè barhimanya; <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>Mukolêse bwinjà amango muhîrwe, bulya zino nsiku ziri mbî. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Kuziga murhabâga bahalanjisi, ci mucîsêze okumanya cici Nyakasane alonza. <verse eid="EPH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Murhahîra mukalaluka amamvu, bulya ly’iriba ly’eby’enshonyi; ci muyunjule Mûka Mutagatîfu. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Mukazibwîrana ennanga, ebîtakîro n’enyimbo z’obunya-Mûka; mukâyimba n’okukuza Nyakasane n’omurhima gwinyu gwoshi. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Ngasi mango n’oku ngasi kantu mukaz’ivuga Nyamuzinda Îshe omunkwa, oku izîno lya Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oku abakristu bakwânîne okuyôrha omu mwa bâbwè</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Mukaz’ikengana mwêne na nnene erhi kurhînya Kristu kurhuma. <verse eid="EPH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Kukwânîne abakazi bayumve bibà nk’oku bankayumva Nyakasane; <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>bulya omu­lumè ye nnawâbo omukazi, nka kula Kristu ye nnawâbo Ekleziya, ye Muciza w’omubiri. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Kulya Ekleziya eyumva Kristu, kwo n’abakazi bakwânîne okuyumva bibà muli byoshi. <verse eid="EPH 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Mwe balume, muzigire bakinywi nka kula Kristu azigira Ekleziya; acîhânyire yo erhumire, <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>mpu ayijire ntagatîfu anayicêse omu kuyishuka n’amîshi haguma n’oluderho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amîshi n’enderho z’obubatizo, ebyo bàdesire.</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>Bulya alonzagya Ekleziya yâge ebè cirangashana, erhagwêrhi izâbyo, erhi migunye-migunye, nîsi erhi bindi bya bene ebyo, ci ntagatîfu na nyêru-kwêru.<verse eid="EPH 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Abalume nabo bakwânîne bazigire bakâbo nka mibiri yâbo bône. Ozigira mukâge erhi yêne ocizigire. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Ntâye osag’ishomba omubiri gwâge; ci kugulîsa omuntu agulîsa n’okuguge­nderera kwinjà, nka kula Kristu ajirira Ekleziya; <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>Bulya rhuli birumbu by’o­mubiri gwâge. <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/><char style="qt">Co cirhuma omuntu aleka îshe na nnina, acîshwêkerekwo mukâge, banabè oku bali babiri mubiri muguma</char><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5, 31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Murh 2, 24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:5">Mat 19, 5</ref>.</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Liri ihwe likulu elyo: nalonza okuderha oku luli lwîganyo lwa Kristu n’Ekleziya. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Ntyo ngasi muguma muli mwe azigîre mukâge nk’oku acîzigira yêne, n’omukazi akenge îba.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Bâna, mukaz’iyumva ababusi binyu muli Nyakasane: okwo kushingânîne. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/><char style="qt">Okaz’ikenga sho na nyoko</char>, -ly’irhegeko lirhanzi lirimwo eciragâne-, <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/><char style="qt">ly’obona iragi onalame myâka minji en’igulu</char><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6, 3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Lub 20, 12</ref>.</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Ninyu, mwe babusi, murhakâg’isholoshonza abâna binyu, ci omu kubalera, mubayigîrize munabahanûle muli Nyakasane.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Bashizi, mukaz’iyumva ba nnâhamwinyu b’en’igulu, mubarhînye munabakenge n’omurhima gurhalimwo bulyâlya, nka kulya mwa­nkajirira Kristu. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>Murhakâg’ikakolera isù nk’abalonz’isimîsa abantu, ci nka barhumisi ba Kristu bajira obulonza bwa Nnâmahanga n’omurhima gwoshi. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>N’omurhima gwinyu gwoshi murhumikire Nyakasane, ci arhali abantu. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Murhahabiri oku ngasi muntu, akabà mushizi, akabà ntagengwa, ayishihâbwa na Nyakasane oluhembo lw’aminjà ajizire.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Ninyu, mwe bashigwa, mukabajirira nk’okwo. Muleke okukâbayôbohya, murhanayibagiraga oku Nnawâbo na Nnawinyu omu mpingu abà, n’oku arhajira kanânà.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Emirasano y’omukristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Cabuzinda-zinda, musimike muli Nyakasane n’omu buhashe bw’emisî yâge. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Muyambale emirasano ya Nyamuzinda, lyo muhash’ihima obwengehusi bwa shetani. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Bulya ababisha rhulwîsa gurhali mubiri na mukò, ci Mâmi, n’Amahashe, n’Amarhegesi g’eri igulu ly’omwizimya; rhulwîsa abazimu babî babêra omu cirêre<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ababisha bîrhu barhali b’en’igulu, ci Shetani yenênè.</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Kuziga muyambale emirasano ya Nyamuzinda, ly’omu mango mabî muhashihagalika omushombanyi, muhimane, munayôrhe muzibuhire. <verse eid="EPH 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Muyimangire kuli gombi! Okuli bubè gwo mukaba gwinyu, obushinganyanya ebè yo mpenzi yinyu, <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>n’obushibirizi bw’okulumîza Emyanzi y’Akalembe zibè zo nkwêrho zinyu. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Muyôrhe mufumbasire empenzi y’o­buyêmêre, yo mwakahazamwo emyampi-kamole y’omubî<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omubî kwo kuderha shetani.</char></note> yoshi. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Muyambale n’ensirha y’obucire n’engôrho ya Mûka gwa Nnâmahanga, lwo Luderho lwa Nnâma­hanga. <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Muyôrhe muharâmya n’okushenga ngasi mango muli Mûka Mutagatîfu; mukâyîza burharhama, munasengerere abatagatîfu boshi. <verse eid="EPH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Munsengere nâni, lyo mbona oku nabumbûla akanwa, nderhe nampanûle n’oburhwâli ihwe ly’Emyanzi y’Akalembe; <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>yo ndi mujà-bugo wayo muno nkoba. Mâshi mbone oburhwâli bw’okuyiderha nk’oku ekwânîne!<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Emyanzi ya Paolo n’omusingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Nnonzize nti ninyu mumanye emyanzi yâni n’oku nyôsire; mwene wîrhu muzigirwa Tikiko, muganda okwânîne okucîkubagirwa muli Nyakasane, â­mmubwîra byoshi. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Mmurhumireye nti ammuhè emyanzi yîrhu anammurhûlirize emirhima. <verse eid="EPH 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Nyamuzinda Îshe na Nyakasane Yezu Kristu bashobôze bene wîrhu omurhûla, obuzigire n’obuyêmêre. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Enshôkano ya Nnâmahanga ebè haguma na balya boshi bazigira Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu omu kalamo karhaheka!<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
